Company Knowledge Assistant
===========================
Single-file system for Recruitbots AI — RAG Engineer Challenge 1.

RAG assistant for employee questions over company documentation, policies,
onboarding guides, and internal knowledge. Uses vector search, returns source
citations, abstains when evidence is missing, and supports multi-turn chat.

No fine-tuned models. Includes retrieval and answer evaluation metrics.
Customer-facing answers have no machine-origin labels.
"""

